OL,3,GNEWSASessions offer advice on rising   
OL,4,Aenergy costs                           
OL,6,FA charity is offering free advice on   
OL,7,Fenergy bills with prices expected to   
OL,8,Fclimb further from January.            
OL,10,FDevon Communities Together said it was 
OL,11,Fhosting drop-in sessions across the    
OL,12,Fcounty, which include help with energy 
OL,13,Fbills, smart meters and switching      
OL,14,Fsuppliers.                             
