OL,3,GNEWSASessions offer advice on rising   
OL,4,Aenergy costs                           
OL,6,FGas and electricity bills for a typical
OL,7,Fhousehold are forecast to rise by #443 
OL,8,Fa year from January. Heating oil prices
OL,9,Fhave also risen drastically since the  
OL,10,Fstart of this year, from about 60p to  
OL,11,F#1.11 a litre, according to the Action 
OL,12,Fwith Communities in Rural England      
OL,13,Fnetwork.                               
OL,15,FDevon County Council said many         
OL,16,Fhouseholds in rural parts relied on    
OL,17,Fheating oil because they were not      
OL,18,Fconnected to mains gas.                
